<p align="start" nodeId="b62af300a71e4d3fad81e6ebba49d661"><span font-size="14">（2）【新增话术】：出现弹窗，默认类型为</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">【客服话术】</span></span><span font-size="14">，提交时校验内容不为空。</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="864e442aae1149a2afd7b14392faac3d"><span font-size="14">（3）【</span><span color=""><span font-size="14">编辑】：按钮入口在鼠标hover到话术内容上，点击icon出现二次确认弹窗，确认后进入编辑态，可编辑话术内容；</span></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="68469e9070a8485eaccff5f9e907a5a2"><span color=""><span font-size="14">（4）【删除】包含二次确认弹窗</span></span></p>
<ul nodeId="7995f2e740954422ab52e63cfa3989c5">
<li nodeId="d5a2a72f212d45d39611f82384c23bcd">
<p align="start" nodeId="3ef6a4af23674f5e8fe5ec01bed3b869"><span color=""><span font-size="14">有引用量不可直接删除： “</span></span><span font-size="14">话术已被规则使用，无法删除。若需删除，请前往规则编辑，解除使用此话术。</span><span color=""><span font-size="14">”</span></span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="bccd8772694e413babbcc1e95d937b1e">
<p align="start" nodeId="9e869d5ad16c46d4af571e55fc699356"><span color=""><span font-size="14">无引用量时二次提示： “</span></span><span font-size="14">确认删除此话术吗？删除将会通知话术的创建者。”</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p align="start" nodeId="cdeee91fb5bc471bb0f5f94e16b4e035"><span color=""><span font-size="14">（5）【被引用量】：点击出弹窗，可查看被哪些规则使用。点击规则名称可跳转到规则详情页。</span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[816]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="7295e3121f7a478f8cfb1e0e933c5f30">
<p nodeId="464ce789964648e597dd28f4079577ff"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1732858245?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="632" height="354" nodeId="7bbbfaeead204288b3f0ab83cd7bddcc" /></p>
<p nodeId="42d309433bd541b4a373851112b30e60"><span font-size="14">新增话术</span></p>
<p nodeId="8d071dcb870641e1ac5511e14c33c8c4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1732838413?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="640" height="384" nodeId="576d06c066b741c6a1bbb50fb3bdceff" /></p>
<p nodeId="9efb20e6c7424a5081e11387fb71790f"><span font-size="14">编辑话术（同风控话术）</span></p>
<p nodeId="f23571a96c56478992886cd7548fd97e"><span font-size="14">删除话术（同风控话术）</span></p>
