<h3 nodeId="0dd7d477bf284604aef47645e46ad7c7">（3）映射话术</h3>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="ce51c854439649b1b25f93478dcc9101">
<tr nodeId="200da371b4ba4077b81c2854e8314b86">
<th colwidth="[99]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="a6999329be04475c9bffa39ab5db8393">
<p nodeId="b87d25baf92c48548771efeab52c40ba"><span font-size="14">入口</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[301]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="163d3f115e7042ebbc83581a67778420">
<p nodeId="51dde2584ff34f87b82aab13b4fb57eb"><span font-size="14">页面说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[808]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(246, 246, 246)" nodeId="c388e976efa84ad4b186caee1691d0b5">
<p nodeId="93cbfd8ded2b4fcf8e386d1297bce53e"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="5f88e24174bf48559836523d9c61f3ec">
<td colwidth="[99]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="94488128d1124b1e812ac116288c6c09">
<p align="start" nodeId="84f54daa1ebc47f1a6cba6efaadf59c2"><span font-size="14">配置中心--&gt;话术管理-映射话术tab</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[301]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="dd5e7bcf30fe45b6bb0c2a1674cba418">
<p align="start" nodeId="a8e915c5dbc247a29911a9edf3bab3d6"><span font-size="14">1.页面展示信息：按三类话术分为三个tab，每个tab下有一个话术列表（包含分页器，10条/页），支持按不同字段排序。</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="861dbd6991f94677bbdc0b8f2c69053c"><span font-size="14">2.操作按钮</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="6ec444119e43406989a13600037b4a75"><span font-size="14">（1）筛选/查询：支持话术内容（模糊查询）、话术ID（模糊查询）、最后修改/创建者misID、创建/修改时间（模糊查询）</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="0cd856873ec249049e7c085aeb0da6bc"><span font-size="14">（2）【新增话术】：</span><span color=""><span font-size="14">进入新页面，默认类型为</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">【映射话术】</span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14">，下方关联风控话术的添加方式为</span></span><span color="rgb(25, 144, 255)"><span font-size="14">「点击新增按钮，出现一行内容，输入框输入内容下拉选择，展示当前该空间下的风控话术ID+内容，点击选中一条后内容被添加到框中，再点保存即完成添加，在下方生成一条记录。</span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14">列表点击</span></span><span color="rgb(25, 144, 255)"><span font-size="14">删除关联</span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14">即删去此风控话术的关联。</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">新增关联风控话术，点击保存时，如果该风控话术已关联过其他映射，则保存失败，提示「无法配置，该风控话术已绑定其他映射话术。」</span></span><span font-size="14">。</span></p>
<p nodeId="958eceb70524414cae5bd7bfc82d8e71"><span color=""><span font-size="14">（3）【详情】：点击后出现话术详情弹窗，内容为话术ID、类型（映射话术）、内容以及关联风控话术的列表。点击按钮【编辑】，出现弹窗确认，确认后进入编辑态，也可通过进入外部的话术列表的【编辑】直接进入编辑态；</span></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="f9777891b32f44f8b9c044a014a2c5ec"><span font-size="14">（4）</span><span color=""><span font-size="14">【编辑】：点击后出现确认弹窗，文案「话术内容/关联关系更新后，引用该话术的规则中（含生效规则）的话术内容也将相应发生变更。是否进行编辑？」确认后进入编辑页面，内容逻辑同新增弹窗，仅多展示一项该映射话术的ID，点击【确认修改】时，完成修改；</span></span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="63f67fe4816c49589523619334a1c2f3"><span color=""><span font-size="14">（5）【删除】包含二次确认弹窗</span></span></p>
<ul nodeId="d6ba45302f3f4fd682672e3cd26c4d03">
<li nodeId="ea946e4ec4d84634b66f8d49029106fa">
<p align="start" nodeId="6875bbbad6f94cbcbd86f21b62b5222a"><span color=""><span font-size="14">有关联风控话术时（引用量也可能为0）不可直接删除。</span></span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="394b8311be324b9588a1ac0b84ec4bac">
<p align="start" nodeId="1a51870e06354eff8b697cfe2fcefe4b"><span color=""><span font-size="14">无关联风控话术时（引用量=0）二次确认弹窗 “</span></span><span font-size="14">确认删除此话术吗？删除将会通知话术的创建者。”</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p align="start" nodeId="2ff6ff8a36ca44128c07bced7774bbe7"><span color=""><span font-size="14">（6）【被引用量】：值含义为该映射话术关联的风控话术，各自被规则使用量的总和。点击出弹窗，展示该映射话术的ID、类型、内容。以及可查看被哪些风控话术关联，对应的被哪些规则使用。规则名称点击可跳转到规则详情页。</span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[808]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="375214b74a3948d19c0e49ac6064733b">
<p nodeId="255b69e4b73a4e4a968ef6d03b64e109"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1733504772?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="786" height="443" nodeId="54dc8b78d2b9421aac78f7771075ec0c" /></p>
<p nodeId="2ea2fda90f5740f9b0a74339eb235735"><span font-size="14">新增话术</span></p>
<p nodeId="a7839bdb0650484ab57a37c275661b97"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1733485427?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="786" height="311" nodeId="d62820f424e3452cadaf2c0dfd3c1781" /></p>
<p nodeId="5d13d3d9ac574eea920dc2ccf12fcd74"><span font-size="14">编辑话术</span></p>
<p nodeId="154c626eaab642cfa691686482e6bcfb"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1733661347?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="1587" height="587" nodeId="1be97bd6d2564498bc11a280f5855648" /></p>
<p nodeId="24e18895d353459687d814061d36bba9"><span font-size="14">删除话术</span></p>
<p nodeId="80b8649b64034138b204f745941f064f"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1732737321?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="344" height="174" nodeId="bcf223e9e9e54c9f952c3bd73607ff8a" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1732829530?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="357" height="174" nodeId="32e754d924d8434eb07c5894467dfcfb" /></p>
<p nodeId="dc5e8c11274142b2a5683f427ff2ac9c"><span font-size="14">查看引用</span></p>
<p nodeId="e610669d9ea54777adc92933c5a7f39c"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1302283710/1733700845?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="786" height="475" nodeId="fbc984efd7eb4bcab114bc391aa17a8f" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
