<h2 nodeId="8ae30ece9ab749ba9ffbd6530559c4bf">3.2 在规则中使用话术</h2>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="9494c801d9a744548a506d74a8f3a0c1">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="8cf80cfde6aa4aea9e8da83c288c0977">本部分 与之前功能保持一致，但在话术下拉框中，将仅展示本空间下的话术选项。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<h3 nodeId="9cf9a0be8c6e4797bfa9b9a58f4faa7c"><strong>（1）新建规则</strong></h3>
<p nodeId="65c2acda946f407db30db820d55dab80">新建规则时，进入添加规则属性信息页面，在此页面的最后一项 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">添加话术</span> 处，<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">在风控话术后面的选择框中选择创建的风控话术（原skywalker中的客服备注）</span>，<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">在客服话术后面的选择框中选择创建的客服话术（原skywalker中的客服建议）</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">，点击 </span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">完成</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">，就完成了</span>在创建规则的过程中添加话术和客服备注；</p>
<h3 nodeId="591dbc77a6ba4ec793fc7dad3bbc26e5"><strong>（2）编辑规则</strong></h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="48298af65d2747c7995b2d9658ff62da">同添加规则入口一样，进入规则编辑页面，即可按照上述流程对规则进行修改。<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">不需要修改规则的逻辑信息和测试，</span>直接点击 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">下一步 </span>跳到 规则的 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">属性信息</span> 修改页面，在此页面的最后一项 <span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">添加话术</span> 处，<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">在风控话术后面的选择框中选择创建的风控话术（原skywalker中的客服备注）</span>，<span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">在客服话术后面的选择框中选择创建的客服话术（原skywalker中的客服建议）</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">，点击 </span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)">完成</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">，就完成了</span>在修改规则的过程中添加话术和客服备注；</p>
<p nodeId="55bdf8ebd08445b5b6cb72829fea0b23" />
<h1 nodeId="f0a718f4f56943aab70a7a7e11d67f6b">四、FAQ</h1>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="1126d56e0500471fbd63ced0446b79a4">
<tr nodeId="b3f1a60c39e24856a7937d9929e975eb">
<th colwidth="[55]" nodeId="28eff45dec6244f796b28d999e354856">
<p nodeId="41c299700dc54dd4b0d32780f984ff9a" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[357]" nodeId="61bded30f83645e6948cac69e8e65274">
<p nodeId="3658d1b1fbe34c988ef5442f2460dc67"><span font-size="14">问题</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[451]" nodeId="5a64ebc8aa6e440da244d6ce5b4f77f7">
<p nodeId="072d1caa3c114688b63b459ec3b82532"><span font-size="14">回答</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[348]" nodeId="be1b834c402b460691f376a73895b495">
<p nodeId="bd689941c0b942dcb657d4d3bf1fa972"><span font-size="14">备注</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="3133cbd46d8b45f696a43cbeca154cc8">
<td colwidth="[55]" numCell="true" nodeId="68480b6ce57a4f1fbecb8f7fe8a4b21e">
<p nodeId="45f1f3d123704d3b9eb2b54b13e843e3" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[357]" nodeId="3f82335c59b84dd0be3375efa6920c2d">
<p nodeId="05928b3515de49288baecffe142a20a0"><span font-size="14">话术按照空间隔离，但规则可以跨空间共享。那规则共享到新空间后，其配置的话术将会如何？</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[451]" nodeId="4ce99f4783034721bccf2ea074826d65">
<p nodeId="4835ed3f068040d7aabc01928a3ad4bc"><span font-size="14">规则共享到新空间，其在原空间携带的话术</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">不会一同共享</span></span><span font-size="14">，而是需要用户在新空间为该规则选择新空间下的话术。如果需要和旧空间的话术内容保持一致，</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">只能选择手动新增一条话术</span></span><span font-size="14">，为其配上。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[348]" nodeId="8db0674fcb2d499ab29a6011b4d928fc">
<p nodeId="651821e76e9d40d99f6ebdb06a9107e8" />
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="7b4d320cca214547a39f1fe417045ed3" />
